Package: VIGAT
Type: Package
Title: VLM-Guided Gene Activity Quantification from Single-Cell ATAC-Seq
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Beijie(Paige)", "Ji", email = "beijie0210@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Quantifies gene activity from single-cell ATAC-seq data.
    Renders transcription start site centered coverage plots for marker
    genes, uses a vision-language model to select one compact genomic window
    per gene, and counts fragments in those windows to build a gene-by-cell
    ATAC count matrix.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
